From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lethalbas <lethalbas@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:02:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] build(win): run win_flex with --wincompat

flex 2.6.4 emits '#include <unistd.h>' unless --wincompat is given,
which MSVC cannot resolve (C1083 in Engine/Base/SCANNER.CPP). The old
flex 2.5 Tools.Win32 binary did not need this.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 SamTFE/Sources/Ecc/Ecc.vcxproj                   |  8 ++++----
 SamTFE/Sources/Engine/Engine.vcxproj             | 16 ++++++++--------
 .../SeriousSkaStudio/SeriousSkaStudio.vcxproj    |  8 ++++----
 SamTSE/Sources/Ecc/Ecc.vcxproj                   |  8 ++++----
 SamTSE/Sources/Engine/Engine.vcxproj             | 16 ++++++++--------
 .../SeriousSkaStudio/SeriousSkaStudio.vcxproj    |  8 ++++----
 6 files changed, 32 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)

